      "value": "I've made a Canny about that a while ago, unfortunately it is not a new bug:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/inputfield-with-contenttype-password-now-sets-as-real-value\n\nI'll never understand why it got zero upvotes though\n\nAn even older Canny, although their description is a bit weird, might also talk about the same issue: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/password-for-input-field-keyboard-doesnt-work",
