  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "InputFields can be set to \"password\" and display visual characters as asterisks, while returning their .text value as the correct, uncensored value.\n\nWhen using VRChat's keyboard, this keyboard also sensors the value that is typed, but returns the raw, censored asterisks rather than the underlying value, making this feature unusable.",
